  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Environment Facility - GEF 7</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Environment Facility (GEF) was established as the funding mechanism for three Rio conventions. It is an international partnership of 183 countries, international institutions, civil society organizations and the private sector that addresses global environmental issues within the fields of Climate change, Biodiversity, Land degradation, International Waters, and Chemicals and Waste. The World Bank is the trustee for the GEF. This agreement covers the 7th replenishment of the GEF.</narrative>
  </description>
